  stdout of this round and in src/os/state.json.

HONEST BOUNDARIES
  (a) ZERO payment capability and no network beyond loopback: a buyer still
      cannot pay (no merchant id, server, domain, filing+ICP, appid+secret).
  (b) zero product surface, zero api surface, zero gate number: what changed is
      whether the evidence a write destroys can be seen by a machine.
  (c) the law only knows "the target existed when this write began" - a
      concurrent write from another machine is outside the claim.
  (d) the announcement goes to stdout only; no file content changed, so every
      existing evidence file is byte-identical.
  (e) a re-land whose name also changed is not a replacement and prints nothing;
      that is the intended meaning of the word.
